00:02:26.039 --> 00:02:29.350
<i>Now, conditions have made it
increasingly difficult to contain...</i>


00:02:29.853 --> 00:02:34.895
<i>and high wind continues to spread the
flames at a rate of 260 acres an hour.</i>


00:02:34.896 --> 00:02:35.896
Those fires.


00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:14.211
<i>Authorities are continuing
the manhunt for Butch Latham.</i>


00:03:14.459 --> 00:03:16.525
