Oh. look how
cute you are!


00:27:03.107 --> 00:27:05.057
Here kitty, kitty!


00:27:05.305 --> 00:27:06.084
Here


00:27:14.841 --> 00:27:16.034
Good baby


00:27:18.096 --> 00:27:20.306
You're hungry
aren't you?


00:27:21.286 --> 00:27:22.497
Well, that's all now.


00:27:23.474 --> 00:27:25.042
Bye. Nice to
meet you.


00:27:25.665 --> 00:27:26.461
Bye


00:27:35.353 --> 00:27:37.364
Great. No reception!


00:27:38.566 --> 00:27:40.252
Cellular phones
don't work up here.


00:27:40.253 --> 00:27:41.453
There's no service.


00:27:41.896 --> 00:27:45.282
Besides, you're not allow to have
those on this little excursion.


00:27:47.499 --> 00:27:49.250
You're joking?


00:27:51.634 --> 00:27:53.161
Could it get
any worse?


00:27:55.120 --> 00:27:56.433
Yo, Ranger Bob!


00:27:57.396 --> 00:28:00.637
I was kind of evaluating the
path you have us going on...


00:28:00.747 --> 00:28:03.032
...and I think there a
shorter, easier way.


00:28:03.471 --> 00:28:05.556
- You think?
- Yeah.


00:28:06.563 --> 00:28:07.995
You the computer whiz?


00:28:09.050 --> 00:28:11.459
Clear your credit, clear out
your bank account any minute.


00:28:13.116 --> 00:28:14.043
Just joking.


00:28:14.078 --> 00:28:18.140
This is a navigation system and it's
showing that, we can save like 2 hours.


00:28:18.652 --> 00:28:22.329
Son, the path you’re talking about, is too
close to the ranchers surrounding the park.


00:28:23.103 --> 00:28:26.407
You remember that little talk
we had, about nasty wolves traps?


00:28:26.980 --> 00:28:27.707
Yes.


00:28:27.742 --> 00:28:30.287
But if we're careful and I'm
sure you know the way


00:28:30.396 --> 00:28:32.023
We'll stay
on course!


00:28:37.017 --> 00:28:38.765
He's trying to
torture us!


00:28:47.316 --> 00:28:49.205
Alright, let's
get going.


00:28:52.753 --> 00:28:57.867
OK, everyone be very
quiet and do not move!


00:29:00.580 --> 00:29:01.551
Bebe.


00:29:02.984 --> 00:29:05.311
Did you feed
your new friend?


00:29:11.326 --> 00:29:12.614
Guys, it's
disgusting.


00:29:14.398 --> 00:29:15.284
My eyes are
burning!


00:29:16.395 --> 00:29:17.710
Get the hell away
from my Bebe!


00:29:17.873 --> 00:29:18.641
I'm gonna
throw up.


00:29:19.978 --> 00:29:21.706
This is so gross!


00:29:23.608 --> 00:29:26.549
This is why we do not
feed the animals!


00:29:28.211 --> 00:29:30.351
The stinging in your eyes
will stop shortly


00:29:31.287 --> 00:29:34.679
as far as the smell, there's not alot of
thing we can do about that right now.


00:29:35.700 --> 00:29:41.158
Kiki. I wouldn't advise screaming
again, when you see a wild animal.


00:29:41.723 --> 00:29:45.013
- Bebe?
- I thought it was a forest cat.


00:29:46.352 --> 00:29:48.041
Stay down with
the rest of us.


00:30:20.215 --> 00:30:21.677
Jerry... It's Bob.
Do you copy?


00:30:22.895 --> 00:30:25.351
Jerry here.
I'm at the campsite now.


00:30:26.093 --> 00:30:27.463
Dropping off the gears.


00:30:28.616 --> 00:30:29.566
Roger that.


00:30:53.177 --> 00:30:56.663
OK, here's some soap,
this should help with the smell.


00:30:58.066 --> 00:30:59.341
Falls right down there.


00:30:59.997 --> 00:31:02.673
- Thanks, Ranger Bob.
- Your welcome.


00:31:04.843 --> 00:31:06.611
Go get cleaned.


00:32:26.544 --> 00:32:27.834
Need any help,
Ranger Bob?


00:32:30.340 --> 00:32:32.234
Goodness, Bebe, you
must be freezing?


00:32:39.448 --> 00:32:41.730
I'm gonna go setup
that last tent.


00:32:43.755 --> 00:32:45.042
I can help!.


00:34:31.649 --> 00:34:33.273
We still stink,
Ranger Bob!


00:34:33.862 --> 00:34:35.234
Yes, Candy you do.


00:34:36.125 --> 00:34:38.022
In order not to contaminate
your other clothes


00:34:38.164 --> 00:34:41.210
all of you will wear the same
one tomorrow as you did today


00:34:42.802 --> 00:34:44.924
You want us to put
those clothes back on?


00:34:45.378 --> 00:34:48.914
Yes, unless you want to
smell like a skunk all week.


00:34:49.700 --> 00:34:52.737
- That's so gross!
- I'm really sorry I didn't know.


00:35:06.567 --> 00:35:08.148
Excuse me


00:35:09.618 --> 00:35:12.798
Hey Bebe, maybe you
could make it up to me?


00:35:13.419 --> 00:35:16.436
They're talking about making
us sleep in our own tent.


00:35:17.552 --> 00:35:18.976
I don't think so.


00:35:24.113 --> 00:35:25.451
Nice job, Scab.


00:35:25.789 --> 00:35:29.212
A white power tattoo,
sitting next to a black man.


00:35:29.476 --> 00:35:30.423
Well done son.


00:35:38.619 --> 00:35:40.023
Gotta drain the dragon!


00:35:41.965 --> 00:35:43.634
You have a dragon?


00:35:44.172 --> 00:35:45.738
I love dragons.


00:35:52.415 --> 00:35:55.217
F.Y.I. Ranger Bob.
The food sucks!


00:35:55.845 --> 00:35:57.421
I couldn't even eat mine!


00:35:58.739 --> 00:36:00.784
Well, maybe it wouldn't have burned


00:36:00.947 --> 00:36:06.369
if anyone of you have bothered to
stir it while I was putting up the tents.


00:36:07.425 --> 00:36:09.993
- I helped you
- Yes, you did Bebe


00:36:10.332 --> 00:36:11.141
Thank you.


00:36:12.069 --> 00:36:16.747
Let's talk about what each one of
you want to accomplish this week


00:36:16.994 --> 00:36:18.698
What do you mean, accomplish?


00:36:19.693 --> 00:36:22.314
Like maybe reflecting
why you ended up here?


00:36:23.514 --> 00:36:27.181
Finding redemption, maybe
even forgiveness?


00:36:28.819 --> 00:36:30.411
- Spider!
- Raul


00:36:35.195 --> 00:36:38.841
Actually this is pretty close in size
and color to our spiders here.


00:36:39.437 --> 00:36:41.829
mostly found in trees.


00:36:42.573 --> 00:36:45.258
- Spiders?
- His kidding right?


00:36:46.664 --> 00:36:50.161
You know what? I think it's
time for us all to turn in.


00:36:51.109 --> 00:36:53.811
Men in one tent,
ladies in the other.


00:37:17.832 --> 00:37:19.977
Jerry. Ranger Bob here.
Do you copy?


00:37:23.810 --> 00:37:26.210
Jerry.
Ranger Bob.


00:38:08.487 --> 00:38:09.409
To hell with him.


00:38:40.813 --> 00:38:41.709
Crap.


00:38:44.068 --> 00:38:45.677
What the hell was that?


00:39:45.005 --> 00:39:48.033
Look! I'm drowning
the little suckers


00:39:50.723 --> 00:39:53.941
I'd be careful standing
so close to those fire ants


00:39:58.577 --> 00:39:59.508
Whoa


00:40:00.623 --> 00:40:01.984
Sorry about that.


00:40:11.520 --> 00:40:12.849
Let's go!


00:40:15.643 --> 00:40:17.547
So those little
sucker bite?


00:41:05.271 --> 00:41:06.843
OK, I don't like cheating last time!


00:41:06.878 --> 00:41:09.693
You don't understand,
I'm in the middle of nowhere right now man


00:41:10.068 --> 00:41:12.794
those old people have their
cheque and cash for them. Listen!


00:41:13.367 --> 00:41:14.837
- Alright
- Is this how it works?


00:41:15.861 --> 00:41:17.442
I gotta go.
What?


00:41:17.676 --> 00:41:20.606
- How did you get your phone to work?
- I got a booster for the signal


00:41:21.135 --> 00:41:22.494
Let me make a call!


00:41:23.130 --> 00:41:25.134
Now why would I want to
do anything for you?


00:41:27.143 --> 00:41:28.871
I could tell Ranger Bob!


00:41:30.839 --> 00:41:32.999
Alright 10 minutes... hang back
so nobody can hear you OK?


00:41:33.184 --> 00:41:34.616
You'll make it
up to me later.


00:41:40.813 --> 00:41:42.362
Elaina.
It's me.


00:41:46.004 --> 00:41:50.353
After lunch, I'm going the GPS system as
the saying goes and beat him by 2 hours.


00:41:51.169 --> 00:41:52.552
Ranger Bob
will be mad!


00:41:53.455 --> 00:41:55.644
What he's gonna to say when I beat
him there like 2 hours or more?


00:41:56.334 --> 00:41:57.254
Nothing!


00:42:03.597 --> 00:42:04.515
OK. Goodbye.


00:42:09.890 --> 00:42:12.088
I don't think you've
all given us your best.


00:42:12.394 --> 00:42:15.567
The trash you've missed now, we've just
gonna have to pick up on the way down.


00:42:17.142 --> 00:42:19.670
- Is there any downhill?
- After the uphill.


00:42:21.812 --> 00:42:22.603
Let's go.


00:42:28.237 --> 00:42:29.372
OK. North.


00:42:31.887 --> 00:42:33.919
East. South.


00:43:19.289 --> 00:43:20.524
Find that,
Ranger Bob.


00:43:22.179 --> 00:43:23.200
We're definitely sent
to the top right?


00:43:23.480 --> 00:43:24.204
Oh yeah.


00:43:25.785 --> 00:43:26.812
So what'd you do?


00:43:28.239 --> 00:43:29.602
Poisoned my mother


00:43:30.351 --> 00:43:31.063
Really?


00:43:32.231 --> 00:43:34.072
Not like I wanted to
kill her or anything.


00:43:34.410 --> 00:43:36.313
So about 2 years
less of college.


00:43:37.842 --> 00:43:39.145
Why'd you poison her?


00:43:40.687 --> 00:43:43.923
She'd just ragged
on me all the time.


00:43:45.141 --> 00:43:47.083
About buying too
many clothes.


00:43:47.517 --> 00:43:49.078
My studies.


00:43:49.372 --> 00:43:50.344
My friends.


00:43:50.935 --> 00:43:52.966
So you thought you'd give her
something else to think about?


00:43:53.790 --> 00:43:54.745
Yeah.


00:43:55.723 --> 00:43:57.484
Hey, it worked for
almost a year.


00:43:58.947 --> 00:44:00.987
She always thought
she had the flu.


00:44:02.985 --> 00:44:04.282
Until the bleeding started.


00:44:05.568 --> 00:44:07.301
Must have been
internally or something.


00:44:07.976 --> 00:44:09.390
You're not in jail?


00:44:10.687 --> 00:44:12.151
My mother never
told on me.


00:44:13.796 --> 00:44:15.434
They just got me
stealing the poison.


00:44:24.725 --> 00:44:26.376
Just pick that up.


00:44:26.811 --> 00:44:28.467
Alright, let's pick
up the pace!


00:44:28.941 --> 00:44:29.917
Let's go...


00:44:59.760 --> 00:45:00.575
Ouch!


00:45:01.248 --> 00:45:02.618
- You OK?
- Yeah.


00:45:03.503 --> 00:45:04.696
Oh my god!


00:45:07.825 --> 00:45:09.214
- Sorry
- OK.


00:45:12.856 --> 00:45:13.783
You hear that?


00:45:14.735 --> 00:45:15.779
What was that?


00:45:21.442 --> 00:45:23.312
Don't even mess around
with me like that, OK?


00:45:23.877 --> 00:45:24.892
So what'd you do?


00:45:26.237 --> 00:45:27.971
I used to part time at
this older care place


00:45:29.090 --> 00:45:30.685
Got these old geezers
to trust me.


00:45:31.541 --> 00:45:33.786
Stole their social security
cheques, their money..


00:45:34.708 --> 00:45:35.738
and take their medications


00:45:35.916 --> 00:45:37.870
and I'd replace them with placebo.


00:45:41.732 --> 00:45:43.903
These two old guys...
they died on me.


00:45:44.972 --> 00:45:47.467
- And you didn't go to jail?
- No.


00:45:47.767 --> 00:45:50.465
You see, the cops. They searched
me without a warrant.


00:45:50.684 --> 00:45:51.905
The case was thrown out.


00:45:55.844 --> 00:45:56.771
Your were lucky.


00:45:57.935 --> 00:45:59.338
I was smart!


00:45:59.930 --> 00:46:01.957
It was alright, while
it lasted you know.


00:46:02.542 --> 00:46:04.033
Got a good scam
plan now though.


00:46:05.018 --> 00:46:06.379
Maybe you could help me?


00:46:06.919 --> 00:46:08.392
You see, old people...


00:46:08.965 --> 00:46:10.443
they're so vulnerable.


00:46:10.706 --> 00:46:11.548
They're the perfect target.


00:46:12.077 --> 00:46:14.206
Nobody gives a rat's
ass about them.


00:46:16.084 --> 00:46:17.592
They're just taking up space.


00:46:18.135 --> 00:46:19.531
And natural resources.


00:46:22.380 --> 00:46:24.008
Old people are creepy


00:46:50.856 --> 00:46:51.592
Madam.


00:46:51.927 --> 00:46:53.592
I thought you said we'd
suppose to be there by now?


00:46:53.918 --> 00:46:54.867
Just right up here.


00:47:21.380 --> 00:47:22.271
Wait here.


00:48:05.451 --> 00:48:06.880
Jerry.


00:48:50.150 --> 00:48:52.087
You stink so bad!


00:48:52.731 --> 00:48:55.000
No shit!
So do you!


00:48:55.198 --> 00:48:57.105
You know, I could
really use a beer.


00:48:58.026 --> 00:48:59.129
I could drink one!


00:49:21.078 --> 00:49:22.495
We're not lost right?


00:49:22.958 --> 00:49:24.210
No, it's just right up here.


00:49:27.606 --> 00:49:29.550
It's been more
than 10 minutes!


00:49:30.088 --> 00:49:31.782
"more than 10 minutes"


00:49:32.593 --> 00:49:35.702
If a tree fall in a forest,
do you hear the tree?


00:49:36.398 --> 00:49:37.403
How do you know it’s
more than 10 minute?


00:49:37.647 --> 00:49:39.471
Can you tell the time by
the sun or something!


00:49:39.506 --> 00:49:40.794
Yeah, actually...


00:49:41.709 --> 00:49:43.055
Can I have some of that?


00:49:43.576 --> 00:49:44.677
No.


00:49:49.268 --> 00:49:52.779
Did anybody happened to notice
when Ty and Kiki left us?


00:49:56.603 --> 00:49:58.556
OK.


00:50:02.043 --> 00:50:03.290
Where are they?


00:50:04.186 --> 00:50:05.421
Where's the camp?


00:50:08.853 --> 00:50:10.441
You don't know where
we are do you?


00:50:11.315 --> 00:50:12.676
- We're in the woods, baby!
- What?


00:50:13.040 --> 00:50:14.909
It's not funny.
Ty!


00:50:16.242 --> 00:50:18.785
Look, stop tripping alright!
It's just right over there. Come on!


00:50:19.773 --> 00:50:22.686
You told me the camp,
was on this mountain top!


00:50:23.996 --> 00:50:26.093
- The co-ordinates are off a little bit.
- Ty!


00:50:27.513 --> 00:50:28.751
This isn't funny!


00:50:33.350 --> 00:50:34.482
Should we get there
before dark?


00:50:34.854 --> 00:50:37.393
Yeah, let's just cut
through here.


00:50:43.503 --> 00:50:45.571
My legs!
Argh Man!


00:50:47.766 --> 00:50:49.209
Kiki, help me, Kiki!


00:50:55.328 --> 00:50:57.142
- Oh God!
- It's definitely broken!


00:50:57.661 --> 00:50:59.464
OK, Get my phone,
get my cell phone!


00:51:00.700 --> 00:51:01.646
Give me my phone!


00:51:03.353 --> 00:51:05.310
- Candy has it!
- Argh... man!


00:51:05.873 --> 00:51:07.040
????


00:51:08.562 --> 00:51:12.154
Help, somebody help!


00:51:12.475 --> 00:51:13.715
My legs are killing me.


00:51:17.830 --> 00:51:18.655
<i>Go back.</i>


00:51:20.801 --> 00:51:21.577
<i>Go back</i>


00:51:23.779 --> 00:51:24.609
<i>Go back</i>


00:51:26.891 --> 00:51:27.711
<i>Go back</i>


00:51:30.720 --> 00:51:31.435
<i>Go back</i>


00:51:33.757 --> 00:51:34.641
<i>Go back</i>


00:51:35.304 --> 00:51:38.506
- Scream.
- Help!


00:51:39.598 --> 00:51:41.127
- Help!
- Help!


00:51:41.424 --> 00:51:42.395
- Somebody gotta hear us.
- Please.


00:51:44.130 --> 00:51:46.898
- Help!
- Help!


00:51:51.410 --> 00:51:54.831
OK. Girls cabin to the
right, boys to the left.


00:51:54.986 --> 00:51:56.224
No mixing, no swapping.


00:51:56.618 --> 00:52:00.200
This is Skunk-Off. It will
help with the smell.


00:52:00.495 --> 00:52:02.170
You'll have 1 hour to shower and relax.


00:52:02.270 --> 00:52:04.901
After that you'll have a few
chores to do before it gets dark.


00:52:05.681 --> 00:52:07.020
Alright put your packs away.


00:52:10.862 --> 00:52:11.732
????


00:52:16.093 --> 00:52:17.173
I was in juvenile.


00:52:17.881 --> 00:52:18.688
Is that why you're here?


00:52:20.193 --> 00:52:23.505
No, it was stupid. I was at
a "gang related"...


00:52:23.744 --> 00:52:25.630
shooting incident.


00:52:27.103 --> 00:52:28.427
But they don't have shit on me.


00:52:28.572 --> 00:52:30.191
I was just there.


00:52:30.534 --> 00:52:34.574
Could you imagine a conversation
between Scab and Bebe?


00:52:34.906 --> 00:52:36.894
- Could you call that a conversation?
- No.


00:52:37.218 --> 00:52:39.827
"Scab, have you ever made it a bear?"


00:52:40.475 --> 00:52:43.650
"Have you ever like licked a frog?"


00:52:45.355 --> 00:52:47.219
Idiots... they're all idiots


00:52:49.682 --> 00:52:51.378
That bitch Candy says one word to me


00:52:52.102 --> 00:52:53.268
she would leave this camp alive!


00:52:57.942 --> 00:53:01.817
- Lola Huh?
- My housekeeper name's Lola.


00:53:04.548 --> 00:53:07.250
I'll rather see you
after the showers.


00:53:07.651 --> 00:53:09.090
Definitely.


00:53:41.216 --> 00:53:42.067
Gentlemen...


00:53:42.102 --> 00:53:45.661
Here is a list of things, that
need to be done before dark.


00:53:48.757 --> 00:53:54.237
- Wash out all dirty clothes and hang...
- Hang them up.


00:53:55.165 --> 00:53:57.987
Empty all candy bars, energy bars
from backpacks or persons.


00:53:58.347 --> 00:54:02.717
Turn in all food products, all deodorant,
and scented products, to be bagged.


00:54:05.223 --> 00:54:06.966
How else can we get
into town Ranger Bob?


00:54:09.979 --> 00:54:11.626
Are you trying to sell our stuff?


00:54:12.142 --> 00:54:15.214
Just give me any food
products you might have.


00:54:16.728 --> 00:54:17.536
I don't have anything?


00:54:20.120 --> 00:54:21.044
Me either.


00:54:24.001 --> 00:54:27.866
Fine. You wanna be bait.
Be bait.


00:54:31.018 --> 00:54:33.323
Bait.
Did he just say bait?


00:54:33.991 --> 00:54:36.456
- He's weird man.
- Yeah.


00:54:37.689 --> 00:54:38.952
I'm losing blood.


00:54:41.792 --> 00:54:43.593
Shit.


00:54:45.249 --> 00:54:46.713
The blood!


00:54:50.138 --> 00:54:51.634
Won't that attract
the animals?


00:54:57.857 --> 00:54:59.551
- What?
- Look...


00:55:01.051 --> 00:55:03.485
Turn me around.
I wanna see...


00:55:04.773 --> 00:55:06.106
Argh... Slow!


00:55:09.221 --> 00:55:11.088
There!
Can't you see?


00:55:16.594 --> 00:55:18.832
OK. Wait...
Wait...


00:55:19.348 --> 00:55:21.754
- Oh No!
- Wait... Wait!


00:55:23.322 --> 00:55:24.521
Kiki, don't run!


00:55:29.790 --> 00:55:30.825
Oh God!


00:55:31.095 --> 00:55:31.937
No!


00:55:32.789 --> 00:55:33.749
No!


00:55:36.386 --> 00:55:37.133
Kiki!


00:55:42.251 --> 00:55:43.361
Kiki!


00:55:45.871 --> 00:55:46.892
Bebe!


00:55:48.889 --> 00:55:50.211
- Get out of here!
- Alright!


00:55:52.023 --> 00:55:53.585
Like I haven't seen that before.


00:56:05.995 --> 00:56:06.808
Hi.


00:56:15.225 --> 00:56:16.513
Too perfect.


00:56:16.514 --> 00:56:17.514
My vote's fake.


00:56:20.753 --> 00:56:23.144
However, one touch.


00:56:23.499 --> 00:56:25.646
- So touch them?
- Hey, Bebe!


00:56:26.273 --> 00:56:28.441
Are your tatas silicone?


